<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2700] GridClosureProcessor internal closures are [de]serialized by OptimizedMarshaller even if BinaryMarshaller is configured</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2700</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Usage of OptimizedMarshaller is forced because:&lt;br/&gt;
a. Closures implement Externalizable.&lt;br/&gt;
b. classnames.properties file contains closure class names.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to implement new versions of closures (C1, C1MLA, C2, C2MLA, C4) that can be processed by BinaryMarshaller.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
