                            <comment id="15172013" author="ilantukh" created="Mon, 29 Feb 2016 15:37:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Final changes broke test DynamicProxySerializationMultiJvmSelfTest#testBinary().&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In that test a closure is passed to Compute Grid with dynamic proxy class as a field. BinaryMarshaller cannot handle such case - in BinaryFieldAccessor$DefaultFinalClassAccessor#write() there is no logic for proxy value type.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
